; Stack floor: PM_CALL pops the object, the method and its arguments from its
; own construct (here a full expression that pushed none): the values of the
; enclosing function body are not its to take.  The unit is the member-pointer
; test's, with a FULLEXPR_BEGIN before the PM_CALL.
